# Scouting output: saved web pages and scout run logs. Saved third-party pages carry
# those sites' own embedded keys (e.g. Google Maps), which GitHub secret scanning flags.
# Kept local only. (Fetch-job logs under cities/*/raw/ stay tracked: workflows git add them by name.)
scouting/**/*.html
scouting/**/*.log
cities/*/raw/scouting/**/*.html
cities/*/raw/scouting/**/*.log
